Modifications in this repository
--------------------------------
This repository is a modified version of the upstream project named above.
Per section 5(a) of the license, the modifications below were made on
2026-11-04 and are stated here:

- Added a /legal page publishing the Corresponding Source, build identifier,
  modification statement, copyright notice, and the full license and
  third-party notice texts; the header and footer link to it.
- Added SOURCE (the section 6 written offer) and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, and
  embedded the third-party notices, including both webfont OFL-1.1 texts, on
  the /legal page so they ship with the running service.
- Added SPDX license identifiers and copyright lines to source files.
- Packaging changes: the Dockerfile ships the notice files, declares OCI
  license metadata, and carries SOURCE_URL / SOURCE_VERSION through build and
  runtime; CI runs scripts/check-license.mjs before building.

The analysis features are unchanged by these edits. Any further modification is
recorded in the Git history of this repository.
